      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Evaluation of genes polymorphic system of xenobiotics biotransformation in patients with occupational allergodermatoses showed significantly higher percentage of incidence of polymorphic variants of genes CYP 1A1 *2C and EPHX1 AND-415G compared with population control. A combination of 3 or more adverse hetero--and homozygous gene alleles CYP 1A1, CYP3A4, EPHX1 and deletions of genes GSTM1 and GSTT1, is characterized by earlier (with the experience of work in harmful conditions up to 5 years) development, severe and unfavorable prognosis of occupational pathology of the skin."},
